# Decode caches. Regenerable in ~20 s (seed) / ~40 s (closure), fingerprinted
# against the ROM and the territory map, and DISCARDED automatically when the
# tree moves -- so keeping them in git only preserves stale answers.
#
# ⚠ Both were swept into the repo by a parallel session's blanket `git add`
# before this file existed (commits d6bca6b, c8e9ec4), and .gitignore has no
# effect on an already-tracked path. Whoever owns those commits should
# `git rm --cached` them; until then they will show as modified after every run.
decodes.pkl
raw_listings.pkl
